al players alike, in team modes, free for all and duels.\n\nFEATURES\n- Bot detection: the game fills servers with bots that carry real-looking names. Every one is marked [BOT], every real player [P]\n- ESP: box, name, the weapon they hold, health bar (200 HP), distance, spawn protection, head dot, skeleton, tracers and chams, with a wall check and optional teammates\n- Aim assist: drives the game's own camera angles, so there is no mouse calibration. FOV, separate horizontal and vertical smoothing, sticky target, head / body / nearest, visible only and auto fire\n- Triggerbot: goes through the game's own click path, so it works on mobile too\n- Silent aim: bends the shot itself toward the target, with its own FOV circle and hotkey. Off by default\n- Gun mods: no recoil, no spread, no viewmodel kick and a rapid fire multiplier\n- Movement: WalkSpeed and Fly\n- Humaniser page: turn speed cap, reaction delay, Legit / Normal / Raw presets and a panic key\n- Duels are recorded, so silent aim and the gun mods pause there by default\n\nMOBILE\nWorks on PC and mobile - the panel asks once and scales itself, in German, English and Russian.\n\nHOW TO RUN\n1. Open Hypershot\n2. Paste the loader into your executor\n3. Execute - the panel opens by itself\n4. Press RightShift to show or hide it\n\nNo key, no ads, and it never spends Robux.\n\nOpen source, read it before you run it:\nhttps://github.com/seltonmt012/sel01-rbx/blob/main/games/hypershot.lua","tags":["esp","aimbot","silent aim","triggerbot","no key"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/ARdpzFuKMm","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b","username":"Seltonmt","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0ded360520c1951d28fd502cf078aeca6b05bb87c667cba5445a03bd584b31ec.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b-1787205594420.png"},"lvl":7,"status":"offline","id":"6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":100000},"profile":